### ============================================================
### LIVE SERVER — https://finance.tekbridge.co.za
### (copy of requests.http pointed at the deployed k3s app)
### ============================================================

### Health Check
GET https://finance.tekbridge.co.za/health

###

### Login as admin → copy access_token into the requests below
POST https://finance.tekbridge.co.za/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "m3WD2ZpvmzqZWhJzUjLq"
}

###

### Get current user (admin)
GET https://finance.tekbridge.co.za/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

###

### Upload Apple 10-K FY2024 (streams SSE; ends with "done")
POST https://finance.tekbridge.co.za/api/v1/ingestion/upload
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="source"

https://investor.apple.com
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="10-Q4-2024-As-Filed.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./storage/documents/10-Q4-2024-As-Filed.pdf
--boundary--

###

### List ingested documents
GET https://finance.tekbridge.co.za/api/v1/ingestion/documents
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

###

### Search — net sales (retrieval only, validates Voyage embeddings + Qdrant)
POST https://finance.tekbridge.co.za/api/v1/retrieval/search
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "query": "What was Apple total net sales in 2024?",
  "top_n": 3
}

###

### Generate — full RAG (validates Ollama Cloud generation)
POST https://finance.tekbridge.co.za/api/v1/generation/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "query": "What was Apple total net sales in fiscal year 2024?"
}

###

### Eval — LLM-as-judge (validates judge model)
POST https://finance.tekbridge.co.za/api/v1/generation/eval
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN

{
  "query": "What was Apple total net sales in 2024?",
  "answer": "Apple reported total net sales of 391 billion dollars in fiscal year 2024."
}

###
